.TH STIRSHAKEN 1
.SH NAME
stirshaken \- STIR/SHAKEN command-line utility
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B stirshaken
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B stirshaken
provides command-line helpers for generating keys and CSRs, creating
certificates and PASSporTs, checking JWTs, and running simple STIR/SHAKEN
service workflows.
.SH OPTIONS
Run
.B stirshaken --help
to display the complete command list and options supported by this build.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libstirshaken (3)
